336	
337	The identity for \EXP{+} or \EXP{\boxplus} or \EXP{\dotplus} is 0.
338	
339	The identity for \KWD{juxtaposition} or \EXP{\cdot} or \EXP{\times} or \EXP{\boxdot} or \EXP{\boxtimes} or \EXP{\dottimes} is 1.
340	
341	The zero for \KWD{juxtaposition} or \EXP{\cdot} or \EXP{\times} or \EXP{\boxdot} or \EXP{\boxtimes} or \EXP{\dottimes} is 0.
