406	\Method*{\EXP{\KWD{opr} \mathord{\dottimes}(\KWD{self}, \VAR{other}\COLON \mathbb{Z})\COLON \mathbb{Z}}}
407	
408	The multiplication operator \EXP{\cdot} returns the product of its arguments.
409	The multiplication operators \EXP{\times}, \EXP{\boxdot}, \EXP{\boxtimes}, and \EXP{\dottimes} do exactly the same thing.
