414	\Method{\EXP{\KWD{opr} /(\KWD{self}, \VAR{other}\COLON \mathbb{Z})\COLON \mathbb{Q}}}
415	
416	The binary division operator \EXP{/} returns the quotient of its arguments
417	as a rational number.  Unlike in other programming languages such as Fortran,
418	the operator \EXP{/} does not perform truncating integer division;
419	the operator \EXP{\div} may be used for that purpose.
